WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
You said you have a dog.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.533
[Chris] Yes.

00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:03.590
What's your dog's name?

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:04.423
Potato.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.180
Why did you do that?

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.840
Why did you call it Potato?
It felt like at the time

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.430
we were in London and he
looked kind of like a potato.

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.610
I can't remember, there was some in-joke

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.520
that we've actually forgotten.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.500
And now whenever I'm in the park

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.720
people think I have Irish Tourette's.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.859
Potato!

00:00:21.859 --> 00:00:23.628
(Conan laughs)

00:00:23.628 --> 00:00:24.461
Come here.

00:00:24.461 --> 00:00:26.040
Hey!

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:26.873
I'm actually trying to get him.

00:00:26.873 --> 00:00:27.706
Where is he?

00:00:27.706 --> 00:00:28.539
Hold on.

00:00:28.539 --> 00:00:29.372
Is he there?
I'm gonna show you because,

00:00:29.372 --> 00:00:31.570
hey, listen, he has a
trick I'd love you to see.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:32.450
Oh, I wanna see this.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:33.283
Okay.
All right.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:34.150
Hold on.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:34.983
Potato?

00:00:34.983 --> 00:00:35.816
Oh, come here.

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.100
Good boy.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:38.933
Yeah, good boy.

00:00:38.933 --> 00:00:39.843
Oh, Potato.

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:45.940
It all seems too on the nose, but this is,

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.700
I mean, this is something I
discovered that he could do

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.510
one day when I was just
watching TV, watching a show

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.810
which you'll be familiar with
and the theme tune came on

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.060
and this happened.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:59.643
("The Office" theme music)

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:05.473
(Potato howls)

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:10.323
(Conan laughs)

00:01:12.173 --> 00:01:15.006
Wait, Potato only does does that

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:17.787
when he hears "The Office" theme song?

00:01:17.787 --> 00:01:18.800
"The Office" theme song.

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:19.740
I've no idea why.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.940
There must be some note
in the music that like--

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:25.150
It's so funny because
when it first started,

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:29.560
Potato was looking down,
ears twitching, thinking,

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:31.890
and then it got to the
certain part of the song

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:33.200
and (imitates Potato howling).

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.620
Yeah.

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:35.720
Maybe there's a new,

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.650
there must be an instrument
change in there somewhere,

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:38.803
but it's amazing.

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:41.840
Wow.
Makes me so happy.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:43.290
That's such a sweet trick.

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.590
That's so amazing that
you found the one show

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:49.793
either Potato loves or Potato can't stand.

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:54.208
When your theme song
comes on, he does a fart.

00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:57.780
(Conan laughs)
(Chris chuckles)

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:58.613
It's quite sweet.

00:01:58.613 --> 00:02:00.330
Like, it's just as regular.

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:04.580
Yeah, yeah, I'm sure that
means he really loves the show.

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:05.413
That's my guess.

